{"id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-acceptable-numbering.md","title":"Acceptable partial-recursive numbering","display":"df-acceptable-numbering — Acceptable partial-recursive numbering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-acceptable-numbering","aliases":["72-df-acceptable-numbering"],"display":"df-acceptable-numbering — Acceptable partial-recursive numbering","depends_on":["[[72-df-recursive-function]]","[[72-df-recursive-definition]]"],"source_kind":"local-formal-interface-completion","verification_status":"definition-and-dependency-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-acceptable-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-acceptable-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-acceptable-numbering — Acceptable partial-recursive numbering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f38fcd2964b78d6c\" href=\"?note=f38fcd2964b78d6c\" title=\"72-df-recursive-function\">72-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aeb4dd56db822ff0\" href=\"?note=aeb4dd56db822ff0\" title=\"72-df-recursive-definition\">72-df-recursive-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formal-interface-completion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-and-dependency-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>元理论为 ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak F_n,\\mathfrak T_n\">\\(\\mathfrak F_n,\\mathfrak T_n\\)</span> 及以有限元组为输入的函数图取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aeb4dd56db822ff0\" href=\"?note=aeb4dd56db822ff0\" title=\"72-df-recursive-definition\">72-df-recursive-definition</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecFun},\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}\">\\(\\operatorname{RecFun},\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f38fcd2964b78d6c\" href=\"?note=f38fcd2964b78d6c\" title=\"72-df-recursive-function\">72-df-recursive-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 是唯一零元输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle\">\\(\\vec a^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle\\)</span> 表示串接。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\in\\mathfrak F_1^\\omega\">\\(\\Phi\\in\\mathfrak F_1^\\omega\\)</span> 是待检验的编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathfrak F_{k+1}\">\\(f\\in\\mathfrak F_{k+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathfrak T_k\">\\(s\\in\\mathfrak T_k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(\\vec a)\">\\(s(\\vec a)\\)</span> 是总函数图的唯一值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中定义，不把“标准编号”作为未经展开的条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>使用记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y\">\\(\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\\downarrow\">\\(\\varphi_e\\downarrow\\)</span> 的段落均以一个固定满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 为参数；所有后续实现性或序数记号定义沿依赖链继承同一个参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>、数输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 与输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(x)\">\\(\\varphi_e(x)\\)</span> 的函数记号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)\\)</span> 时使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rec}_n:=\\{f\\in\\mathfrak F_n:\\operatorname{RecFun}(f,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rec}_n:=\\{f\\in\\mathfrak F_n:\\operatorname{RecFun}(f,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_\\Phi:=\\{\\langle\\langle e,x\\rangle,y\\rangle:e,x,y\\in\\omega,\\ \\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi(e)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_\\Phi:=\\{\\langle\\langle e,x\\rangle,y\\rangle:e,x,y\\in\\omega,\\ \\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi(e)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SMN}_\\Phi(k,f,s):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{RecFun}(f,k+1)\\land\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}(s,k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec a\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\ \\bigl(\\langle\\vec a^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi(s(\\vec a))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi)=\\mathsf{Rec}_1\\land\\operatorname{RecFun}(U_\\Phi,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathsf{Rec}_{k+1}\\ \\exists s\\in\\mathfrak T_k\\ \\operatorname{SMN}_\\Phi(k,f,s).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SMN}_\\Phi(k,f,s):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{RecFun}(f,k+1)\\land\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}(s,k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec a\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\ \\bigl(\\langle\\vec a^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi(s(\\vec a))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi)=\\mathsf{Rec}_1\\land\\operatorname{RecFun}(U_\\Phi,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathsf{Rec}_{k+1}\\ \\exists s\\in\\mathfrak T_k\\ \\operatorname{SMN}_\\Phi(k,f,s).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi(e),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)&amp;:=\\{x\\in\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y)\\},\\\\\n\\varphi_e\\downarrow&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)=\\omega,\\\\\n\\varphi_e(x)&amp;:=\\iota y\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y)\\quad(x\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi(e),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)&amp;:=\\{x\\in\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y)\\},\\\\\n\\varphi_e\\downarrow&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)=\\omega,\\\\\n\\varphi_e(x)&amp;:=\\iota y\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y)\\quad(x\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点只补齐原稿已经使用的计算结构：一元部分递归函数的枚举、通用计算图与参数化条件。定义不要求所有索引表示总函数，也不把未定义的输出当成自然数。s-m-n 的选码函数规定为总递归；没有对任意可接受编号额外宣称它必须原始递归。这里没有引入新的实现性变体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"f38fcd2964b78d6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"aeb4dd56db822ff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"aeb4dd56db822ff0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"元理论为 ZFC。$\\mathfrak F_n,\\mathfrak T_n$ 及以有限元组为输入的函数图取 [[72-df-recursive-definition]]；$\\operatorname{RecFun},\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}$ 取 [[72-df-recursive-function]]。$\\langle\\rangle$ 是唯一零元输入，$\\vec a^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle$ 表示串接。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"f38fcd2964b78d6c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"元理论为 ZFC。$\\mathfrak F_n,\\mathfrak T_n$ 及以有限元组为输入的函数图取 [[72-df-recursive-definition]]；$\\operatorname{RecFun},\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}$ 取 [[72-df-recursive-function]]。$\\langle\\rangle$ 是唯一零元输入，$\\vec a^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle$ 表示串接。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak F_n,\\mathfrak T_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RecFun},\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\in\\mathfrak F_1^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathfrak F_{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathfrak T_k","display":false},{"tex":"s(\\vec a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rec}_n:=\\{f\\in\\mathfrak F_n:\\operatorname{RecFun}(f,n)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"U_\\Phi:=\\{\\langle\\langle e,x\\rangle,y\\rangle:e,x,y\\in\\omega,\\ \\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi(e)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SMN}_\\Phi(k,f,s):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{RecFun}(f,k+1)\\land\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}(s,k)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec a\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\ \\bigl(\\langle\\vec a^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi(s(\\vec a))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi)=\\mathsf{Rec}_1\\land\\operatorname{RecFun}(U_\\Phi,2)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathsf{Rec}_{k+1}\\ \\exists s\\in\\mathfrak T_k\\ \\operatorname{SMN}_\\Phi(k,f,s).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi(e),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)&:=\\{x\\in\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y)\\},\\\\\n\\varphi_e\\downarrow&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)=\\omega,\\\\\n\\varphi_e(x)&:=\\iota y\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y)\\quad(x\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3076,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-469","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-acceptable-numbering|可接受编号]] 服务于第四章的 Kleene O 与第六章的数实现性，不表示原书新增编号。"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-414","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]"},{"id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-acceptable-numbering]] 中满足 $\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)$ 的编号，沿用其 $(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\omega}$ 与计算图；$\\varphi_e(m)\\downarrow=k$ 表示该部分函数在 $m$ 上有定义且值为 $k$。这是元语言中固定的计算结构，不是算术对象语言的全函数符号。"},{"id":"c924a0bbc6eed2cd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-acceptable-numbering]] 的 $\\Phi$，满足 $\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)$；本文件以 $\\phi_e$ 记同一 $\\varphi_e$。$\\phi_e(n)$ 只在 $n\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)$ 时取唯一值，$\\phi_e\\downarrow$ 表示该一元部分函数全定义。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-469","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-acceptable-numbering|可接受的部分递归编号]]：明确通用计算图、定义域以及 s-m-n 选码条件。"},{"id":"cdd1728c22275ffc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-acceptable-numbering]] 中满足 $\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)$ 的编号 $(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\omega}$；$\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=m$ 是该固定计算结构的图关系。$f\\in\\omega^\\omega$。"},{"id":"2b8a73334f8550a1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-acceptable-numbering]] 的可接受编号 $\\Phi$；$\\operatorname{PCA}$ 使用 [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]]。$G_\\Phi$ 由下式给出；$a,b,c\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"75662f8a477e661f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"编号与参数化条件取 [[72-df-acceptable-numbering]] 的 $\\operatorname{Acceptable}$、$\\operatorname{SMN}$；固定有限参数的选码函数要求总递归，不对任意可接受编号附加未声明的原始递归选码条件。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-acceptable-numbering|可接受的部分递归编号]]：明确通用计算图、定义域以及 s-m-n 选码条件。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-acceptable-numbering]]"}],"outgoing":["f38fcd2964b78d6c","aeb4dd56db822ff0"]}